<li class="break-words">How the cosmological ‚Äúeffective fluid‚Äù encoding maps to RSVP at a technical level.</li>
<li class="break-words">How the idea of ratchets in computation goes beyond ASCII into architectural lock-in, especially the von Neumann architecture, and what alternatives were possible.</li>
</ol>
