<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Aim: Ground the essay‚Äôs ‚Äúratchet‚Äù thesis in a clear emergence framework (Wimsatt‚ÄìCahoone) that lines up with RSVP‚Äôs parity of fields.</p>
