<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">where is the attractor basin. Purpose is not an external design, but the natural drift toward entropy-minimizing attractors that stabilize structure.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Examples:</p>
