<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">An eye‚Äôs ‚Äúpurpose‚Äù is vision: the attractor of photoreceptor entropy reduction.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">A market‚Äôs ‚Äúpurpose‚Äù is price discovery: the attractor of collective informational coherence.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">5.5 Mathematical Models of Teleonomy</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">5.5.1 Cybernetic Feedback</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The canonical cybernetic loop in RSVP:</p>
