<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">5.5.3 Cognitive Purpose</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">For cognitive systems, purpose manifests as minimizing predictive entropy:</p>
