<hr class="border-border-l2">
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">20.2 RSVP as Meta-Naturalism</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Where Cahoone offers a pluralistic metaphysics of ontological parity‚Äîall systems, processes, and structures are equally real‚ÄîRSVP provides a mathematical implementation. Every order of nature is not only real but computable as a scalar‚Äìvector‚Äìentropy field. This transforms metaphysical pluralism into meta-naturalism, a universal framework where:</p>
