<hr class="border-border-l2">
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">20.4 Toward a Unified Natural Philosophy</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The integration of Cahoone‚Äôs Orders of Nature with RSVP yields a unified natural philosophy where metaphysics, physics, and epistemology converge:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\text{Reality} = \bigcup_{n} { \Phi_n, \mathbf{v}_n, S_n },</p>
